{"3056780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gun Poker", "steam_appid": 3056780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gun Poker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up poker night with Gun Poker, where your poker hand gives you a leg up in shooter action right on the table! Use your wits and your FPS skills to come out on top against 2-6 friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/574ef57cfe414b2beef0194467c316c8.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Gunplay gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/574ef57cfe414b2beef0194467c316c8.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/574ef57cfe414b2beef0194467c316c8.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rapid-fire rounds of Texas Hold 'Em poker and FPS PvP until one player holds all the chips. Weigh the odds and raise the stakes when it counts to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/4553fc7b7a818f14f85d9a9492d91694.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Transistion to FPS gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/4553fc7b7a818f14f85d9a9492d91694.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/4553fc7b7a818f14f85d9a9492d91694.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Poker Hand Determines Your Gun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A better hand will yield a better gun, but having the best gun on the field will not guarantee victory. Take advantage of grenades, dashing, and the chaotic environment to defeat an opponent with a stronger loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/0f04e18b1ec14ba6cd9122aade430333.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Possible hands gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/0f04e18b1ec14ba6cd9122aade430333.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/0f04e18b1ec14ba6cd9122aade430333.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are physically simulated. Use your grenades to topple card castles and domino structures to corner or smoke out your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/6c5b693748788294d7182b6f4ec4389f.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Destructible maps gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/6c5b693748788294d7182b6f4ec4389f.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/6c5b693748788294d7182b6f4ec4389f.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private or public lobbies up to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 destructible maps and 4 background environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card and table skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand cheat sheet for players new to poker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple exciting game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker-only mode</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gun Poker</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up poker night with Gun Poker, where your poker hand gives you a leg up in shooter action right on the table! Use your wits and your FPS skills to come out on top against 2-6 friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/574ef57cfe414b2beef0194467c316c8.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Gunplay gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/574ef57cfe414b2beef0194467c316c8.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/574ef57cfe414b2beef0194467c316c8.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rapid-fire rounds of Texas Hold 'Em poker and FPS PvP until one player holds all the chips. Weigh the odds and raise the stakes when it counts to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/4553fc7b7a818f14f85d9a9492d91694.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Transistion to FPS gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/4553fc7b7a818f14f85d9a9492d91694.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/4553fc7b7a818f14f85d9a9492d91694.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Poker Hand Determines Your Gun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A better hand will yield a better gun, but having the best gun on the field will not guarantee victory. Take advantage of grenades, dashing, and the chaotic environment to defeat an opponent with a stronger loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/0f04e18b1ec14ba6cd9122aade430333.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Possible hands gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/0f04e18b1ec14ba6cd9122aade430333.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/0f04e18b1ec14ba6cd9122aade430333.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destructible Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All maps are physically simulated. Use your grenades to topple card castles and domino structures to corner or smoke out your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/6c5b693748788294d7182b6f4ec4389f.poster.avif?t=1786747712\" aria-label=\"Destructible maps gif\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/6c5b693748788294d7182b6f4ec4389f.webm?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/extras/6c5b693748788294d7182b6f4ec4389f.mp4?t=1786747712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private or public lobbies up to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 destructible maps and 4 background environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card and table skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand cheat sheet for players new to poker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple exciting game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker-only mode</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Outsmart or outshoot your friends in this poker/FPS hybrid for 2-6 players. Hit better poker hands to get better guns for PvP showdowns in chaotic, destructible arenas. Believe in your cards or your skills and place your bet!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/568c0320937e5e113085eafc85829fa5f7a8252f/header.jpg?t=1786747712", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/ec2d4729e1b8ced62256c2aba8e9cde182895118/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786747712", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/ec2d4729e1b8ced62256c2aba8e9cde182895118/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786747712", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "copyright Squires Systems 2026", "developers": ["Squires Systems"], "publishers": ["Squires Systems"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/68e9f5b949ce4f5b882c794f3de1dfdc501fb5d1/ss_68e9f5b949ce4f5b882c794f3de1dfdc501fb5d1.600x338.jpg?t=1786747712", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/68e9f5b949ce4f5b882c794f3de1dfdc501fb5d1/ss_68e9f5b949ce4f5b882c794f3de1dfdc501fb5d1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786747712"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/34c1465fc7c9aa97f95b0261e4a9aa83db04114c/ss_34c1465fc7c9aa97f95b0261e4a9aa83db04114c.600x338.jpg?t=1786747712", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056780/34c1465fc7c9aa97f95b0261e4a9aa83db04114c/ss_34c1465fc7c9aa97f95b0261e4a9aa83db04114c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786747712"}, {"id": 2, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets